  "description": "Stops Umbraco sites being OOM-killed in memory-limited containers while browsing the media section. Caps the unmanaged buffer pool ImageSharp retains and bounds how many images are processed concurrently, both derived from the memory available to the process. Backport of the fix proposed in umbraco/Umbraco-CMS#23557 for Umbraco 17 sites that need it now.",
